What is Hygienic Wall & Ceiling Cladding?
Hygienic wall & ceiling cladding refers to specialized surface materials designed for environments requiring strict cleanliness standards, including hospitals, pharmaceutical facilities, food processing plants, and cleanrooms. These systems feature seamless, non-porous surfaces that resist bacterial growth while being durable and easy to clean. Unlike traditional wall finishes, hygienic cladding eliminates joints and crevices where microbes can accumulate, making them essential for infection control protocols.

